      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "s2_sub_013_picnic_chair_02",
      "hash64": "8FC821AC036A8916",
      "text": "Oho... Well, I’ll be! So this design is from a place\\ncalled Blueberry Academy, is it?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "s2_sub_013_picnic_chair_03",
      "hash64": "8FC822AC036A8AC9",
      "text": "I’ll try making some new chairs based on this\\ndesign!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "s2_sub_013_picnic_chair_04",
      "hash64": "8FC823AC036A8C7C",
